== 19:22:00 5/8 a policy pinning another machine as the standby (the primary's measurement): the chip verifies, the release is denied on the record
== 19:22:00 6/8 a good policy, the newest bundle corrupted in the replica: generation 1 set aside on the record, generation 0 restored
== 19:22:23 7/8 the spent policy again: refused at the door
